{"4259320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gods vs Steam", "steam_appid": 4259320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire Survivors and Path of Exile inspired bullet hell gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield Lightning Force to grab, pull, and hurl enemies and the world itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match skill tree upgrades to create powerful, unexpected builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an ancient god, unleash overwhelming divine powers, and survive relentless waves of steampunk enemies. Grow stronger with every run, unlock powerful abilities and synergies, and shape your own godlike build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Awaken divine powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259320/extras/89d17e915db8d17f915bdaa121bb8a0c.poster.avif?t=1787769364\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259320/extras/89d17e915db8d17f915bdaa121bb8a0c.webm?t=1787769364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259320/extras/89d17e915db8d17f915bdaa121bb8a0c.mp4?t=1787769364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unleash devastating abilities that shatter anything before you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grab, pull, and throw enemies and objects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259320/extras/80394b4dab90e2cff6f2fce651add7fc.poster.avif?t=1787769364\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259320/extras/80394b4dab90e2cff6f2fce651add7fc.webm?t=1787769364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259320/extras/80394b4dab90e2cff6f2fce651add7fc.mp4?t=1787769364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment itself as a weapon — almost everything can be grabbed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face multi-phase bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259320/extras/f3e598ee3a044c3f1bf8bfb41e91bd02.poster.avif?t=1787769364\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259320/extras/f3e598ee3a044c3f1bf8bfb41e91bd02.webm?t=1787769364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259320/extras/f3e598ee3a044c3f1bf8bfb41e91bd02.mp4?t=1787769364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenging bosses that evolve mid-fight with new attacks, arenas, and mechanics. Every phase raises the stakes and pushes your abilities to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire Survivors and Path of Exile inspired bullet hell gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield Lightning Force to grab, pull, and hurl enemies and the world itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match skill tree upgrades to create powerful, unexpected builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>